{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31435","headline":"重阳日次荆南路经武宁驿 · 崔橹","name":"重阳日次荆南路经武宁驿","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"茱萸冷吹溪口香，菊花倒遶山脚黄。\n家山去此强百里，弟妹待我醉重阳。\n风健旱鸿高晓景，露清圆碧照秋光。\n莫看时节年年好，暗送搔头逐手霜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔橹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31435.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31435","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}